# GD-4 (round 19, writer 10): L §5.16 Decisions and projections: a decision's projection with neither a random clause
# nor a query around the read "is refused: at load where load sees the projection reach the random fact after the
# decision's day (LOAD-RANDOM, §8.3), otherwise at the read (RUN-FUTURE)"; L §8.3 item 9: a move's day computed from
# keys of a declared index through built-ins that read no fact is seen. L5_16_decision_projection_future_path with
# save and buy on start_of(m): load sees save[2026-01]'s projection over [2026-01-01, end_of(2026-01)] take buy[2026-02]
# (dated end_of(2026-01)), whose amount reads spend[2026-02] at end_of(2026-02), after t. The run with the load check
# taken out refused the same instance and fact (RUN-FUTURE, spend[2026-02] at 2026-03-01); with day_of(m, dom), a row,
# the days aren't seen and the run refuses (L5_16_decision_projection_future_path).
=== m.tally
model r
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source own "own"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind spends: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2020-01-01..
place savings: accounts PLN lives 2020-01-01..
place shop: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input spend_mu: money PLN
input spend_sd: money PLN
input spend_dom: int
input dom: int
input floor: money PLN
def spend[m in months]: dist PLN = normal(spend_mu, spend_sd) to 1e-9 at end_of(m)

move buy[m in months]: spends
  on start_of(m)
  at end_of(m)
  leg cash from konto to shop amount round(spend[m], minor(PLN), half-even)

move save[m in months]: transfers
  on start_of(m)
  at start_of(m)
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to savings amount max(0 PLN, bal(konto, end_of(m)) from start_of(m) - floor)

version v
  cite own
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  spend_mu = 1 000.00 PLN "own"
  spend_sd = 100.00 PLN "own"
  spend_dom = 15 "own"
  dom = 5 "own"
  floor = 8 000.00 PLN "own"
  opening[konto] = 10 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "statement"
  opening[savings] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "statement"

ask p1: bal(savings, 2026-01-31) paths 2 seed 1 path 1
=== expect
refused: LOAD-RANDOM save[2026-01] on 2026-01-01: bal(konto, end_of(m)) from start_of(m) reaches random spend[2026-02] after 2026-01-01 with no random clause or query (m.tally:30)
